From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wave: own station security, buffers and statistics

Bind station reservations, keys and statistics to the confirmed SID incarnation.
Preserve acknowledged authorization/revocation, management payload extent and
receive/transmit ownership. Report native activity without IRQ timing probes.

This is the final native integration against the pinned vendor source.
Firmware-dependent policy remains downstream with exact image admission.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>

